OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fscattered showers at first, heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes, but these gradually fading out
OL,8,Fthrough the evening. Mostly dry
OL,9,Fovernight with variable cloud and
OL,10,Fclear spells.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FAfter a mostly dry start it
OL,13,Fwill turn unsettled with showers or
OL,14,Flonger spells of rain, heavy at times.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FQuite
OL,17,Fbreezy and cloudy as rain clears
OL,18,FThursday morning, then a mostly dry,
OL,19,Fbright afternoon. Bright start Friday,
OL,20,Fshowers later. Dry interludes between
OL,21,Fspells of showery rain on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
